{"unit_id":"tag:041K:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节找出数量众多（large）的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的性质，它们在fpqc拓扑（fpqc topology）下关于基底是局部的。对于概形（schemes）的态射（morphisms）的情形，请比较下降（Descent），节<REF_0001>。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"large","target_term":"数量众多"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"large","target_term":"数量众多","context":"large number的普通数量修饰，当前来源词汇命中待核实。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"所讨论的对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所讨论的箭头，未批准。"},{"source_term":"fpqc topology","target_term":"fpqc拓扑","context":"局部性所用拓扑，未批准。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"对应情形的对象，未批准。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名，未批准。"}],"notes":[]}
