{"unit_id":"tag:041L:proof","translation":"我们使用引理<REF_0001>证明此结论。该引理的假设（1）和（2）由空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>得到。设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>拟紧（quasi-compact）。我们要证明<MATH_0005>拟紧（quasi-compact）。为此，再次使用空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0003>，只需证明对于每个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，纤维积（fibre product）<MATH_0008>拟紧（quasi-compact）。下图说明这一情形：\n<MATH_0009>\n注意，所有方块都是笛卡尔的（cartesian），底部方块由仿射概形（affine schemes）组成。<MATH_0010>拟紧（quasi-compact）的假设与<MATH_0011>仿射（affine）这一事实一起推出<MATH_0012>拟紧（quasi-compact）。由于<MATH_0013>作为<MATH_0014>的基变换（base change）是满射的（surjective），可知<MATH_0015>拟紧（quasi-compact），见空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0004>。证明完成。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fibre product","target_term":"纤维积"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"cartesian","target_term":"笛卡尔的"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射的"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的